{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bao Boi</strong> is a fast-paced vertical climbing platformer. With only one life, you\u2019ll dash, jump, and weave through traps and enemies to reach the top of each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level introduces new hazards and unique enemies to keep each climb unpredictable. Collect gems for an extra challenge, race against the timer, and see how quickly you can conquer all three climbs. Death is instant, retries are instant\u2014can you reach the summit in one life?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One life, one climb\u00a0</strong>\u2013 every mistake means instant death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast retries</strong> \u2013 jump back in immediately after failing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 unique stages</strong> \u2013 each with their own traps and enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional gem collecting</strong> \u2013 extra challenge for daring players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race the timer</strong> \u2013 push for the best times</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tight, responsive controls</strong> \u2013 built for precision platforming</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939630/extras/357ca3df19848e7b9a6b429e349d5ff7.avif?t=1758825052\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939630?t=1758825052","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939630?t=1758825052","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939630/c6f6eb9ba3e9981e3803755bda2138f9228138e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758825052","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse